Location: Amsterdam, Netherlands  

Company: Geely Auto Netherlands B.V.  

Duration: 3\-6 months (flexible)  

Working hours: 32\-40 hours/week  



**About the Role**  



Geely Auto Netherlands B.V. is looking for a motivated Finance Intern to support our Finance team in daily operations and financial projects.




This internship is designed as a learning opportunity for students. The intern will work under supervision and gain practical experience related to their academic background.  



**Key Responsibilities**

* Support daily finance operations, including invoice processing and financial administration;
* Assist with accounts payable and accounts receivable activities;
* Support monthly financial reporting and data analysis;
* Help maintain and improve finance\-related processes and documentation;
* Assist with financial data collection and preparation of reports;
* Support ad\-hoc finance projects as required.
* Learning Opportunities

 **During the internship, you will gain practical experience in**

* Finance operations within an international company;
* Financial reporting and analysis;
* ERP/finance systems and business processes;Cross\-functional collaboration with different departments.

 **Requirements**

* Currently pursuing a Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Finance, Accounting, Economics, Business Administration, or a related field;
* Strong interest in finance and business operations;
* Good analytical and problem\-solving skills;
* Good command of English (written and spoken). Dutch and Chinese will be an advantage;
* Proficient in Microsoft Office, especially Excel;
* Detail\-oriented, proactive, and willing to learn.

 **What We Offer**

* Internship opportunity in a fast\-growing international automotive company;
* Hands\-on experience in finance operations and business processes;
* Guidance from experienced professionals;
* Internship allowance according to company policy.  

Opportunity to build professional experience in an international environment.


